83
00:04:34,890 --> 00:04:36,430
Now let's talk about

84
00:04:36,430 --> 00:04:37,890
each type of atelectasia.

85
00:04:39,910 --> 00:04:42,550
Obstruction or resorption
of atelectasis.

86
00:04:43,890 --> 00:04:45,970
It is caused by a mucus

87
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:47,630
or a mucopurulent plug.

88
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:50,270
As mentioned before,
this is seen in

89
00:04:50,270 --> 00:04:52,870
bronchial asthma,
bronchiectasis or in chronic

90
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:55,810
bronchitis. It is
also seen in patients

91
00:04:55,810 --> 00:04:59,410
with foreign body
inhalation and might be

92
00:04:59,410 --> 00:05:02,510
determined by an intra
-bronchial tumor or

93
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:05,730
an enlarged lymph node
